<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>For My Love ❤️</title>
<style>

body{
background: linear-gradient(#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
height:100vh;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-family:Arial;
text-align:center;
color:white;
}

.box{
background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
padding:40px;
border-radius:20px;
}

h1{
font-size:40px;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.6;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="box">
<h1>🌹 For You 🌹</h1>

<p>
Even if distance separates us,<br>
my heart is always with you.<br><br>

These flowers are for the most beautiful girl in my world 🌸<br>
I miss you, I think about you,<br>
and I can't wait to see you again ❤️
</p>

</div>

</body>
</html>
